message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Startup Valuation Engine"
version: "0.2.0"
authors:
  - family-names: "Mak"
    given-names: "Simon"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0000-0000-0000"
abstract: >
  A comprehensive Python library implementing 80+ startup valuation formulas
  from the Startup Valuation textbook. Includes an MCP server for AI agents
  and AI-Agent Skills for workflow guidance. Covers probability theory, time
  value of money, CAPM, Scorecard, Berkus, VC Method, Black-Scholes, Monte
  Carlo, SaaS metrics, biotech rNPV, fintech, marketplace, hardware,
  international valuation, stakeholder analysis, and emerging topics.
keywords:
  - startup valuation
  - venture capital
  - financial modeling
  - Black-Scholes
  - Monte Carlo
  - MCP server
  - AI agents
  - SaaS metrics
  - biotech valuation
  - fintech
repository-code: "https://github.com/simonplmak-cloud/startup-valuation"
license: MIT
type: software
date-released: "2026-05-20"
